 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>你的冒险从神秘古迹上的不祥之地开始。你受无尽的贪欲驱使，追寻名望、力量与数不尽的财富，一路冲破险阻，解开黑暗的秘辛，实现自己那注定沉沦的野心。</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >携手勇闯黑暗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和最多四名玩家组队冒险，或者孤身一人深入黑暗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >自定义所有装备</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用各个部件组装武器：长剑、钉锤、战斧、长柄武器、长枪、弓箭、弩箭，随你选择。利用各种素材、涂装和纹饰定制装备，完美契合你的游玩风格与审美偏好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >永久死亡机制</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色一旦阵亡，人物本身及身上所有携带物资都将永久消失。如果想带着辛苦搜集的战利品脱身，必须小心谨慎。只有将物品存放在营地内才能万无一失。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc1b49d5616a4535f63b9.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >升级你的基地</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >带着从地牢搜集的资源返回营地，还可以进行营地维修和升级。借助营地的各项升级，为下一场寻宝之旅保驾护航，探寻更多上古秘闻与珍稀宝藏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/fa9e46cc89666cbf5ceb947e40d3d318.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >探索被遗忘的地牢</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可怖的怪物与致命的机关，还有摇摇欲坠的建筑、隐秘的战利品与致命的毒气——地牢危机四伏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >沉溺于禁忌之中</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >摒弃世俗虔诚，挣脱虚无之境的束缚，与黑暗之神缔结契约，换取禁忌之力。切记：每一份力量都需付出相应的代价。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>你的冒险从神秘古迹上的不祥之地开始。你受无尽的贪欲驱使，追寻名望、力量与数不尽的财富，一路冲破险阻，解开黑暗的秘辛，实现自己那注定沉沦的野心。</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >携手勇闯黑暗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和最多四名玩家组队冒险，或者孤身一人深入黑暗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f06584d8352d0cd117b7dfc6427ce86a.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >自定义所有装备</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >用各个部件组装武器：长剑、钉锤、战斧、长柄武器、长枪、弓箭、弩箭，随你选择。利用各种素材、涂装和纹饰定制装备，完美契合你的游玩风格与审美偏好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/710e4f71682f83231a7e6a4f756041eb.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >永久死亡机制</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色一旦阵亡，人物本身及身上所有携带物资都将永久消失。如果想带着辛苦搜集的战利品脱身，必须小心谨慎。只有将物品存放在营地内才能万无一失。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/226e46d0017dc