ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.poster.avif?t=1788281007\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.webm?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/f48b85f707e8a4d466ae79fe7fc5de31.mp4?t=1788281007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
 "short_description": "在这款中世纪合作搜打撤游戏中，勇闯禁忌地牢，追寻秘闻与宝藏。打造武器，定制装备，与最多四名盟友并肩作战。在废墟中求生——一旦失败，所有携带物都将付诸东流。",
